# Crypto Exchange Domain Rules for Loon (Common, no card-region binding)
# Checked 2026-10-31 against public sources (official help pages/docs, v2fly, blackmatrix7, scan sites).
# Evidence labels used below:
#   [official] found on the exchange's own site/docs/announcements
#   [community] listed consistently by v2fly / blackmatrix7 (not official proof)
#   [indirect] seen loaded/linked by the exchange's own site, or third-party scan data
# Anything with no evidence found is kept in a commented "UNVERIFIED" block per exchange.
#
# Requires Loon build 1008+ for DOMAIN-WILDCARD.
# The policy is not part of the rules; it is set where this rule set is referenced.
#
# Exchanges whose card is tied to specific regions have their own files
# (one file + one Crypto_* select group each, see myLoon4Mac.conf [Proxy Group] Crypto_*):
#   Crypto_OKX.list  Crypto_CryptoCom.list  Crypto_Coinbase.list  Crypto_Kraken.list
#   Crypto_Bybit.list  Crypto_KuCoin.list  Crypto_MEXC.list  Crypto_Bitget.list
# Do NOT repeat their domains here: the first matching rule wins, a duplicate here would shadow them.
#
# NOTE on wildcards: "brand.*" matches any host that STARTS with "brand." and
# "*.brand.*" any host containing ".brand.", so lookalikes such as brand.attacker.com
# also match. It only routes traffic via the policy, but it is not a strict ownership check.

# ============================================================
# Binance
# Card: original Visa EEA card closed 2023-12-20. 2026 press reports a Mastercard relaunch in Brazil, CIS and
# some African markets, but Binance publishes no country list and none was confirmed for your regions.
# ============================================================
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,binance.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.binance.*
# [community] Chinese mirror domains
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,binancezh.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.binancezh.*
# [community] static assets / CDN
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bnbstatic.com
# [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bntrace.com
# [community] app API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bsappapi.com
# [community] exchange SaaS backend
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,saasexch.com
# [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,saasexch.cc
# [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binanceapi.com
# [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancecnt.com
# [community] blackmatrix7
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancefuture.com
# Related but NOT owned by Binance (enable only if you use them):
# BNB Chain: community-driven, listed by v2fly under binance
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bnbchain.org
# Removed: bsc.news (independent media), trustwallet.com (no longer Binance-owned since 2025-05-15)
# UNVERIFIED:
# docs use pay.binance.com / merchant.binance.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancepay.com

# ============================================================
# Gate (formerly Gate.io)
# Card: Gate's FAQ (2026-03-03) publishes no country list (eligibility shown only in the application flow).
# Gate-Visa rollout to 40+ markets announced 2026-10-08, list not published. Gate US runs a separate US card.
# Move to its own file once the list is published and it matches one of your regions.
# ============================================================
# [official]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.io
# [official] new main domain since 2025-05-19
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.com
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateio.live
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gatedata.org
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gatecn.io

# ============================================================
# HTX (formerly Huobi)
# Card: no evidence of a current Visa/Mastercard card program found.
# ============================================================
# [official]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,htx.com
# [official] legacy domain, acquired by Huobi in 2013
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huobi.com
# Wikipedia lists www.hbg.com as the exchange site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hbg.com
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hbfile.net
# mentioned in a review, not confirmed
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huobi.global

